[[- define "change-pov.instructions" -]]
Change only the point of view. Keep every fact, name, rule, detail, and the tone, and keep the formatting.
[[- end]]

[[- define "change-pov.system" -]]
[[- $rules := or (eq .Field "system_prompt") (eq .Field "post_history_instructions") -]]
[[template "field-rules" .]]

[[if eq .PointOfView "first" -]]
Rewrite it in first person, in {{char}}'s own voice: I, me, my.[[if $rules]] It sets rules for the roleplay, so make them enforce first person: {{char}} speaks as I and never breaks character.[[end]]
[[- else -]]
Rewrite it in third person: he, she, they, or {{char}}; never I, me, or my outside quoted dialogue.
[[- if or (eq .Field "first_mes") (eq .Field "mes_example")]] Narrate {{char}} as an omniscient narrator; dialogue stays in {{char}}'s voice.[[end]]
[[- if $rules]] It sets rules for the roleplay, so make them enforce third person: narrate {{char}} as he, she, or they.[[end]]
[[- end]]

[[.Instructions]]

Return only the JSON object: no code fence, no commentary.
[[- end]]

[[- define "change-pov.user" -]][[template "field.user" .]][[end]]
